{
  "Combat.Amily.AmilyConcentration.AmilyTakesA": "Amily takes a deep breath and attempts to concentrate on your movements."
  "Combat.Amily.AmilyDartGo.AmilyDashesAt": "Amily dashes at you and swipes her knife rather slowly. You easily dodge the attack; but it was all a feint, her other hands tries to strike at you with a poisoned dart. Luckily you manage to avoid it."
  "Combat.Amily.AmilyDartGo.AmilyDashesAt2": "Amily dashes at you and swipes her knife at you, surprisingly slowly. You easily dodge the attack; but it was a feint - her other hand tries to strike at you with a poisoned dart. However, she only manages to scratch you, only causing your muscles to grow slightly numb."
  "Combat.Amily.AmilyDartGo.YouVeBecome": " You've become so weakened that you can't even make an attempt to defend yourself, and Amily rains blow after blow down upon your helpless form."
  "Combat.Amily.BeforeAttacked.AmilyEasilyGlides": "Amily easily glides around your attack thanks to her complete concentration on your movements.[pg]"
  "Combat.Amily.React.AmilyEasilyGlides": "Amily easily glides around your attack thanks to her complete concentration on your movements.[pg]"
  "Combat.Amily.Teased.AmilyFlushesHotly": "Amily flushes hotly; her concentration only makes her pay more attention to your parts!"
}
